bottomparticipants

actor User
boundary "Comment Section (UI)" as UI
boundary Router
control CommentController
control CommentService
entity VoteCommentModel
database MongoDB

User -> UI: 1. Click Upvote
activate User
activate UI

UI -> Router: 2. POST /upvote
activate Router

Router -> CommentController: 3. upVote(comment_id, req)
activate CommentController

opt Token / Role Invalid
    CommentController --> Router: 3.1 401 / 403 Error
    Router --> UI: 3.2 Show error
    UI --> User: 3.3 Error message
end

CommentController -> CommentService: 4. upVote(comment_id, payload)
activate CommentService

CommentService -> CommentService: 5. checkUser(payload)
activate CommentService
space
deactivate CommentService

loop User not exist / User is banned
    CommentService --> CommentController: 5.1 Error
    CommentController --> Router: 5.2 400 Error
    Router --> UI: 5.3 Show error
    UI --> User: 5.4 Error message
end

ref over User, MongoDB: 6. Subsequence - Vote comment 1